title: 'parachains/disputes: remove the dead ValidatorSetCounts storage item'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `ValidatorSetCounts` in the slashing pallet is dead: nothing reads or writes it anywhere in
    the codebase. `ValidatorSetCount`, the value it would cache, is always computed fresh from
    session info or the key ownership proof instead. Removes the declaration; no migration
    needed since nothing ever wrote to it.
crates:
- name: polkadot-runtime-parachains
  bump: patch
